src/mlx_serve/ (generated by scripts/prepare.sh, not committed) holds the files of mlx-serve's src/ this plugin compiles,
at their mlx-serve paths, from the commit in MLX_SERVE_REF: the slices scripts/slice.txt (the model) and
scripts/slice-stream.txt (the expert streamer) name, with the Metal kernels and other files they embed and the read
pool's C (sdk/weights/streamed/csrc/q3_lookahead4_exl3.c, q3_lookahead4.h). overlay/mlx_serve/ is copied over it: the
files in the script's EDGES list, which are this plugin's own code at mlx-serve paths, not copies. patches/turboexl3.patch
then edits the copies (the EXL3 arm); the patch is this plugin's.

src/host_shims.zig stands in for mlx-serve's sdk/weights/streamed/csrc/mlx_event_shim.cpp, mlx_alloc_shim.cpp,
mlx_launch_cache.inc and q3_event_shim.mm (their C symbols, over the server's host table); it is this plugin's code.

